    "created_at": "2016-10-04T01:23:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-04T01:23:16Z",
    "body": "I think this is the desired behavior as it matches general expectation from native apps, so I'd suggest we add `user-select: none` in user agent style sheet. And it still makes sense to allow authors and users to revert this behavior via specifying `user-select` in their style sheets.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
