    "created_at": "2016-10-04T01:37:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-04T01:37:09Z",
    "body": "And people against this usually state that everything else is selectable in web pages, which is simply not true. Are we going to allow text inside buttons to be selectable? Or items in select lists to be selectable?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
