    "created_at": "2016-10-04T04:15:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-04T04:15:37Z",
    "body": "That “disabled controls are entirely non-interactive“ note was added in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/65216fce862018e2052a7edd24485e41839dae6d and the commit message doesn’t reference any bug number or discussion.\n",
