    "created_at": "2016-10-08T06:04:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-08T06:04:22Z",
    "body": "> Text inside buttons and select boxes is selectable in Chrome and Edge (I don't have Safari to test with).\n\nActually, no. Text inside `<button>` is selectable, but text inside `<input type=\"button\">` is not. You may want to make them consistent.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
