    "created_at": "2016-10-08T06:06:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-08T06:06:48Z",
    "body": "I still think the spec should say one way or the other. I'm fine to make Gecko match the spec even if it requires the different way, although I don't quite agree with it.\n",
