    "created_at": "2016-10-10T07:34:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-10T07:34:23Z",
    "body": "Actually, in Blink, if you select text around a textarea, the content inside the textarea is also selected. That matches what CSS UI 4 says for [`user-select: contain`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#valdef-user-select-contain).\n",
